<node id="typora-export">
  <data key="d0">typora-export</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Typora-Export是一个与文档导出相关的系统或工具，用于在Typora编辑器中将内容导出为特定格式，如HTML或PDF。&lt;SEP&gt;Typora-export is an organization or system component associated with exporting documents, particularly in a structured format with outlines and styling, as indicated by the presence of classes like 'typora-export-content' and 'typora-export-sidebar'.&lt;SEP&gt;typora-export是Typora编辑器在导出文档时使用的特定样式和布局模式，用于生成格式化的输出文件。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-64d1892be270e1fabca311dceb22f149&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fee549ab2aee4316de61c569a60c298&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ee128446c959d05e83f1e1fea95c8f</data>
