  <data key="d2">Typora-Export-Sidebar是Typora导出功能中的一个侧边栏组件，用于显示导出选项或导航内容。&lt;SEP&gt;typora-export-sidebar is a category or structural component used for the sidebar in exported documents, with fixed positioning and specific width and margin settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4fee549ab2aee4316de61c569a60c298&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ee128446c959d05e83f1e1fea95c8f</data>
