  <data key="d2">Typora-Export-Show-Outline是一个用于控制导出时是否显示文档大纲的设置或类别。&lt;SEP&gt;typora-export-show-outline is a category or layout class that enables the display of an outline in exported documents, controlling the flex layout of content and sidebar.</data>
